		{
			dependencies: ["268F1E0871E3F46F"]
			description: [
				"Use the &4compass&r to locate the nearest lunar research base. To activate the compass, hold it in your main hand and press the right mouse button. "
				""
				"The &4compass&r is also very useful for finding other structures. To change the search structure, hold the compass in your hand and press Shift (crouch) + right mouse button."
				""
				"&bOxygen&r is the most important resource on the moon. Always monitor your reserves in your suit. To refill your suit, you need a tank containing oxygen. Hold the &etank&r in your hand and press the right mouse button."
			]
